🚀 Make YOU the central character

Don't make it only:

“I interviewed X.”

Make it:

“Come with me as I spend one week meeting the people building the next generation of Web3.”

That creates a story arc around your content.



Your recurring CTA could be:

“I’m meeting builders all week. Who should I talk to next?”

That naturally gets founders, developers and your audience involved.

📈 One conversation = a content machine

For example, a 15-minute founder conversation could become:



1 Full podcast
 2 3–5 Reels
 3 Founder quote graphic
 4 X thread
 5 Behind-the-scenes story
 6 Founder collaboration post
 7 Audience Q&A clip



So instead of trying to create 10 completely different pieces every day, you're multiplying one real interaction into multiple formats.

